WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.440
Team AL4 versus Team Q4!

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.770
The third match!

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.660
The second turn has ended,

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.220
and Q4 suddenly has 3 damage!

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.980
Next, it's Q4's turn.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:15.150
Hopefully, they'll show us an exciting fight!

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:16.280
Indeed!

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.840
Here I go.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.860
I activate Barcgal's skill!

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.700
I superior call Future Knight, Llew!

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:34.940
Counterblast!

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:39.050
Llew, Barcgal and Flogal go to the Soul!

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.920
Stand up, my avatar!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.260
Superior ride!

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:50.640
Blaster Blade!

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.080
I see!

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.850
Aichi purposely accumulated damage 
in order to superior ride, and...

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:32.000
Blaster Blade Counterblast!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.610
Use this skill!

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:38.240
Prisoner Beast,

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.220
exit the field!

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:50.620
I'll use everything I've 
accumulated up to now...

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:54.010
and go all out to win this match!

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:59.940
Demon World General

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.560
I call Gordon and Wingal!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:10.730
With a boost from Wingal, 
Blaster Blade attacks!

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:14.270
Drive trigger...

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:20.130
Damage trigger check.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.300
Stand trigger is activated.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:26.520
I add +5000 to the power of Prisoner Beast.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.520
Succubus stands!

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:37.580
Gordon doesn't have enough 
power to damage Prisoner Beast.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:38.900
In that case...

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.660
Gordon, go after Succubus!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:51.730
If his attacking power is weakened now,

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.010
it'll be easier for Aichi to 
get through the next turn.

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:58.150
And then Aichi will be able to bombard 
with attacks on <i>his</i> next turn...

00:03:59.120 --> 00:03:59.980
I draw.

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.830
I ride Werwolf Sieger!

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:10.270
I call Blue Dust!

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.310
With a boost from Nightmare Baby...

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.190
Blue Dust attacks!

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.880
With Nightmare Baby's skill, 
+4000 is added to Dust's power.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:28.070
I also activate Blue Dust's skill.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:29.610
Soulcharge!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:32.790
His Soul is piling up...

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.660
Be careful...

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:39.010
In a Dark Irregulars deck, the 
Soul has an important meaning...

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:42.090
Werwolf Sieger, attack!

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:46.200
Gordon, over to you!

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.040
Especial Intercept!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.600
Driver trigger check.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:56.480
That's the end of my turn.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.040
He's got 0 damage, to Aichi's 3...

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.900
Can Aichi recover?

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:07.360
I'll attack him with all I've got this turn!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.110
Enter the fray, King of all Knights!

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.990
I ride King of Knights, Alfred!

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:25.760
With Alfred's skill, his power increases 
with each rear-guard unit of the same clan...

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.370
However, under these circumstances...

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:30.100
I call!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.530
I activate...

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.010
Gigantech Charger's skill!

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:41.920
I superior call Future Knight, Llew!

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.030
And then I call again!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.040
Royal Paladin allies,

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.900
give Alfred the power of the Knights!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.910
I see. Impressive.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.270
Gigantech Charger...

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:04.110
attacks Werwolf Sieger 
with a boost from Llew!

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:06.910
I guard with Hades Puppet Master!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.000
Next, I'm attacking with Alfred!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.530
Twin drive, first check!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.020
Second check!

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:23.620
Heal trigger!

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:26.510
I add +5000 to the power of Gallatin!

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:29.480
And then I heal damage!

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:34.680
Feel the great power of the sacred sword!

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:37.220
Great Sword Attack!

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.700
Damage check.

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:44.590
I attack with Gallatin, boosted by Marron!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.400
Damage check.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:03.690
Oh, boy! AL4 and Q4 are lined 
up for the damage race at last!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:08.080
Q4's Aichi is steadily coming 
up from behind, isn't he?

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:15.340
So you've picked up some experience 
from watching people play?

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:20.860
However, that level of 
experience is nothing to me...

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:22.760
I draw!

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.800
Crawl out of the Gates of Hell...

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.840
Bring forth the power of evil!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.640
I ride Demon World Marquis, Amon!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.500
I activate his skill!

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:44.310
Give me all of your cursed power of darkness!

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:48.690
Amon can receive +1000 power for 
each card that's in the Soul.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.140
I call Alluring Succubus!

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:54.280
I get to Soulcharge with her skill!

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:56.620
Another card put in the Soul!

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.900
This is what the Dark 
Irregulars deck is about!

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:04.440
Pile up the Soul and turn it into power!

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:09.680
That's right. He rules over the 
souls of the soldiers of darkness...

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:13.580
That's why Tetsu is called the "General".

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.440
Nightmare Baby boosts...

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.180
Go, Blue Dust!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.010
I guard with Elaine!

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:24.030
Demon World Marquis, Amon!

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:26.810
Attack with a boost from Succubus!

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:31.870
Twin drive, first check.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.980
Second check.

00:08:35.420 --> 00:08:37.150
Critical trigger?!

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:39.390
I add +5000 to the power of Amon!

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.000
And the extra critical!

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.130
What should I do?

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:58.490
How should I fight an 
opponent who's this tough?!

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:00.970
Picture it!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.610
Picture yourself as strong 
as the knight on that card!

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.580
That's right. How could I forget 
the most important thing?

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.580
I have to imagine...

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:22.760
Everyone...

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:41.550
That's right! I can still 
become much stronger!

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.210
I draw!

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.060
Here I go!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.700
Sacred dragon!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.850
Bring forth your mystic power!

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:51.560
I ride...

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:54.430
Soulsaver Dragon!

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:16.170
I Soulblast 5 cards!

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.690
Soulsaver Dragon!

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:22.310
Holy Charging Roar!

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:32.830
Three of my rear-guard 
units gain +5000 power!

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:36.140
Now I can unleash my most powerful attack!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.160
Right here... for sure!

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:39.610
Here it comes!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:40.990
Can he win it?!

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:44.710
I don't know, but now he 
at least has a chance.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:46.000
With a boost from Marron,

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:48.370
Gallatin attacks!

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:53.200
Damage check.

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:55.530
Stand trigger is activated!

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.490
I add +5000 to Amon's power.

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.390
And Blue Dust stands.

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.320
That much?!

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:07.370
Soulsaver Dragon!

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.690
Attack with a boost from Wingal!

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:20.170
March Rabbit of 
Nightmareland defends completely!

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:23.530
I don't believe it...

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:27.410
Soulsaver Dragon's attack was blocked?!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:31.220
Kamui!!

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:38.600
W-What was that about?!

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.540
What are you doing at a time like this?!

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:43.520
When sweet Aichi is doing his best!

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:45.060
S-Sweet Aichi?!

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:47.310
Miss Emi...

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.580
Gouki?!

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:52.890
Aichi is giving his all for you, Kamui!

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:57.510
We met the Team Caesar guys...

00:11:57.510 --> 00:11:59.600
And we heard from Aichi...

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:04.310
He said he wants to fight alongside 
you in the finals, Kamui!

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:08.490
So he's doing everything he can 
to win this elimination match!

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:10.740
Nagisa...

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.260
Gigantech Charger!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.010
Attack with a boost from Llew!

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:17.800
Aichi...

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:22.700
Aichi's attack went through, so 
now Tetsu's damage is also 5!

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:25.360
You abandon a great teammate like him...

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:29.370
That's not the Kamui I love!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:33.390
Kai, what do you think 
a teammate really is?!

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:39.410
As a result, Tetsu has lasted 
to the end of this turn.

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:43.140
Yes. Aichi's attack was a thrilling one,

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:45.260
but he wasn't able to win this turn.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:48.910
I'm sure this comes as 
a major shock to him...

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.110
When the going gets rough for a 
teammate, you stay by his side.

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:53.990
That's what a teammate does...

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:59.640
Kamui, right now, if he 
heard you rooting for him...

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:02.490
I'm sure Aichi could do anything!

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:11.400
I admit that you've 
mastered Soulsaver Dragon.

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:15.130
But even so, you fall far short of me!

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.030
I draw!

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:21.010
Now you'll learn...

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:24.180
your own weakness and true despair!

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:28.100
Wicked wings, flap in the darkness!

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.300
Stil Vampir!

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:53.080
Soulcharge.

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:55.700
With his skill, his power increases by +2000.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.070
And I call Werwolf!

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:01.030
Now I activate Vampir's other skill!

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:04.950
Counterblast and Soulblast!

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.420
Stil Vampir...

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.400
moves Llew from your rear-guard 
to the Vanguard circle!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.530
Oh, no!

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:28.880
What is this?!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.200
I can't believe it!

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:35.030
W-With this,

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:37.660
what happens to Soulsaver Dragon?

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:40.310
This is the skill of Stil Vampir.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:46.740
During this turn, my enemy's Vanguard 
becomes the rear-guard of my choosing...

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.790
Certainly, you have what it takes.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:54.560
But you're still wet behind the ears.

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:58.330
And that's why you may be able to challenge 
me, but you definitely won't win.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:02.240
Future Knight, Llew... A warrior boy 
who dreams of becoming a knight...

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.640
That is the perfect form 
to match your power now!

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:12.880
Brother!!

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:20.290
Brother, hang in there!!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.100
Kamui!

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:34.780
I'm not going to give up yet!

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:37.990
My transformation into Llew 
is for this turn only...

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:40.410
If I can ride it out, I'll 
be able to turn back!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:44.390
And then, in my next turn, 
I'll win this match!

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:47.520
Kamui and I will go to the finals together!

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:50.110
Werwolf, go!

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:54.900
I guard with Epona!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.570
Alluring Succubus gives me a boost!

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:07.040
I guard with Iseult...

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:12.420
Llew is grade 0!

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:16.100
So I can only use grade 
0 units to guard Llew!

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:21.810
If you were still Soulsaver Dragon, 
you would've been a grade 3...

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.770
You probably could've 
been able to block my attack,

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.450
but now Future Knight, Llew 
is in the Vanguard circle!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:33.130
Just like I said, right now you can't even 
see your own power, your own weakness!

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.800
This is another brutal attack!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.140
<i>Oh</i>, yes, it is, indeed!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.460
He's crushing his opponent's 
last bit of hope to pieces,

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.800
while presenting him with despair and fear.

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:47.450
Is this how the General of AL4 rolls?!

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:51.440
Twin drive...

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:09.880
Brother...

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:16.250
The winner is Tetsu of AL4!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:19.320
And so Team AL4 has won all three fights,

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.490
getting past the elimination round!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.840
This time, I didn't get to fight you...

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.340
but definitely one day...

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.300
I...

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:06.920
At last, A Block's final fight!

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:10.320
Team Jurassic Army versus Team Muscle Brain!

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:15.090
In the first match, it's Ryudou 
Gunji versus Kick Shuu!

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:23.770
The heated A Block fights are all over!

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:27.770
The results of all the A Block teams are...

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:29.560
Team Q4
Team Jurassic Army
Team Muscle Brain
Team FFAL4

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:29.520
Here!

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:31.190
What the...?

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:33.770
Three teams have one win and two losses?!

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:39.290
Team Q4
Team Jurassic Army
Team Muscle Brain
Team FFAL4

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:39.300
Two teams can proceed to the finals...

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:42.450
But only AL4 has clinched it.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:44.540
Then what about the other team?

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.240
Can Q4 make it to the finals?

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:49.960
Hi, Ultra-rare here!

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:53.450
The scores for A Block are lined up nicely!

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:54.810
I mentioned this in the beginning,

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:58.040
but in a situation like this, we look 
at the results with a sharp eye.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:01.000
This is the scoreline of each team.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:02.310
Team Q4
Team Jurassic Army 0-2
Team Muscle Brain 2-0
Team FFAL4 1-2
Total: 3 wins, 4 losses

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.300
First, Q4.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:07.900
We've totaled the number of wins and losses 
of all the matches for each team...

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:10.670
and then calculated the 
difference with points.

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:14.170
The team with the highest number 
of points will go to the finals!

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:17.020
And the results are...

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:17.820
Team Muscle Brain -3

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:18.940
Team Jurassic Army 0

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:20.940
Team Q4 -1

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.940
Breaking out of the Elimination Round are AL4

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:28.280
and Jurassic Army!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.120
Still, we did well.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:46.380
Okay, I'm going to the tournament's 
operations headquarters...

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:47.980
Kai...

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:52.960
I... It's my...

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:57.180
I finally found you, Kai.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:01.040
I've been looking for you for a long time.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.760
Ever since you disappeared on me...

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:05.850
It's been a long,

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:07.850
long time...

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:14.130
But I can't believe you ended 
up on such a weak team.

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:17.420
You can't honestly be satisfied.

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:19.960
So why did you join a team like this?

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:23.790
You know plenty of players 
who are much stronger.

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:29.000
If you apologized to me, I would...

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:31.280
It doesn't matter what kind of team I'm on.

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:33.580
Anything's better than being with you.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.350
Kai...

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.330
Kai!

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:40.200
If you'd won even one match...

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:44.590
the calculation of this team's 
scoreline would've been different...

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.130
and you probably would've 
seized a come-from-behind win.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:51.520
And, Kai, in the finals,

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.980
you would've been able to fight me.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:57.060
It's all your fault.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:58.710
Hey, that's enough!

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:01.770
Misaki, Ren is right...

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.650
Right? You know what I mean...

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:10.620
In fact, you don't belong on this team...

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:12.670
Especially not with Kai...

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.100
Where's Kyou?

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:20.760
I sent him back to headquarters.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.740
For retraining...

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:26.070
He was the only loser at today's tournament.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:29.550
Everyone else on the other two 
participating Foo Fighter teams

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.920
was undefeated in every match.

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:35.530
I'm sure this will continue in the 
finals, with people realizing...

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:37.970
the fearsome strength of the Foo Fighters.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:41.570
How well-known have we become?

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:45.200
You should take a look at the 
finals and realize yourself.

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:46.980
Kai...

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:52.440
What he said is true...

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:58.590
The weakest fighter in Team Q4 is... me.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:03.800
Brother!

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:07.070
Brother...

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:08.040
Brother!

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:10.650
It's my fault Q4 lost...

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:13.430
Because I'm so weak...

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:18.460
I don't belong with Q4... 
I don't belong on the same team as Kai!

00:23:50.830 --> 00:23:53.340
It's my fault Team Q4 lost...

00:23:53.340 --> 00:23:54.830
That's right.

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:57.740
You're not good enough for the team.

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:02.410
It's like having a turtle on a team of 
rabbits. There's a reason they won't win.

00:24:02.410 --> 00:24:05.650
Shut your mouth! You're 
saying Brother's a turtle?!

00:24:05.650 --> 00:24:09.390
No. You, who wore a rabbit 
mask, may be the turtle...

00:24:09.390 --> 00:24:11.540
Next: Blaster of Darkness!

00:24:11.540 --> 00:24:13.150
Picture it.

00:24:13.150 --> 00:24:16.930
Us, in our true forms, against rabbits...

00:24:17.370 --> 00:24:19.250
Can't you see our sharp fangs?
